                        "review": "Very eloquent racism, makes me feel very smart for laughing at the asian voice hahahaha sometimes I reminisce that I'm back in the good old days of MW2 lobbies where this would have sold millions of copies if ya know what I mean hehe the guys who get it get it. Anyway, whats been up with u guys how have you been. I recently just started using dating apps again and its been well lets just say not so good. When I mention I'm a gamer all the girls just say weird things like thats stupid, why are you in my house, who left the door unlocked and stupid stuff like that. Nobody seems to care how much I'm there for them.  Any tips for hittin on the ladies would be much appreciated. Anyway yea this game freaking sucks!",
